# Workflow

```
RTL
Specification
Interface
      │
      ▼
 RTL Parsing
      │
      ▼
 RTL Summary
      │
      ▼
 Store into RAG
      │
      ▼
 Retrieve Context
      │
      ▼
      LLM
      │
 ┌────┼─────┐
 ▼    ▼     ▼
SVA   TB  Coverage
      │
      ▼
 Simulation
      │
      ▼
 Debugger
      │
      ▼
 Verification Report
```

